      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 32.359,
      "end": 39.259,
      "text": "Short ones, and quiet ones. A garden, a familiar kind of cafe, or a drive with music he likes. Avoid crowds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 42.899,
      "end": 49.349,
      "text": "That's normal. Build in time for yourself each day, even twenty minutes, and ask a friend to take over for an afternoon if you can."
